{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\Books\\6th\\Math\\JPG\\048.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Example 7:", "conf": 0.818, "box": [[180, 102], [361, 102], [361, 143], [180, 143]]}, {"text": "Solve (-5) - (+1)", "conf": 0.898, "box": [[176, 170], [433, 164], [434, 208], [177, 214]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.85, "box": [[176, 236], [328, 236], [328, 274], [176, 274]]}, {"text": "Keep the first number i.e. -5 unchanged. Next, change the operation from subtraction to", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[170, 299], [1562, 266], [1563, 327], [171, 359]]}, {"text": "addition and also change the sign of +1. It will become -1. Then add according to the", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[171, 366], [1519, 336], [1520, 391], [172, 422]]}, {"text": "rules of addition of integers.", "conf": 0.887, "box": [[175, 438], [602, 436], [602, 472], [176, 474]]}, {"text": "(-5) -(+1) = (-5) + (-1)", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[176, 507], [536, 501], [536, 538], [177, 544]]}, {"text": "Takethe absolutevaluies", "conf": 0.906, "box": [[177, 570], [545, 567], [545, 600], [178, 603]]}, {"text": "[-5] = 5 and /-1] = 1", "conf": 0.786, "box": [[175, 634], [481, 629], [481, 669], [176, 674]]}, {"text": "Addtheabsolutevalues", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[176, 700], [538, 698], [538, 731], [177, 733]]}, {"text": "5+1=6", "conf": 0.797, "box": [[175, 763], [300, 763], [300, 798], [175, 798]]}, {"text": "Putthecommonsignwiththe.answer.", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[175, 827], [760, 824], [760, 859], [176, 863]]}, {"text": "So, (-5) - (+1)= - 6, We can also show the difference of the integers on the number line", "conf": 0.924, "box": [[173, 891], [1549, 873], [1550, 913], [174, 931]]}, {"text": "Draw a number line and start at O and reach the point (-5) on the number line. Move 1 step", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[178, 947], [1551, 933], [1552, 975], [179, 989]]}, {"text": "to the left of-5, we get-6.", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[175, 1012], [557, 1011], [557, 1048], [175, 1049]]}, {"text": "-6(5 -4 -3 -2 -1 ", "conf": 0.796, "box": [[396, 1150], [819, 1141], [820, 1184], [397, 1193]]}, {"text": "Example8:", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[166, 1255], [351, 1255], [351, 1292], [166, 1292]]}, {"text": "The sum of two integers is -45. If the smaller integer is -75, find the greater one.", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[177, 1322], [1398, 1321], [1398, 1360], [177, 1361]]}, {"text": "QuickCheck", "conf": 0.876, "box": [[1097, 1429], [1290, 1429], [1290, 1463], [1097, 1463]]}, {"text": "Sum of integers = -45", "conf": 0.876, "box": [[179, 1465], [510, 1460], [510, 1497], [180, 1502]]}, {"text": "Findthedifferencebetween", "conf": 0.934, "box": [[1096, 1496], [1467, 1500], [1466, 1530], [1095, 1526]]}, {"text": "Smaller integer = -75", "conf": 0.863, "box": [[177, 1533], [501, 1527], [501, 1567], [178, 1573]]}, {"text": "-75and-34.", "conf": 0.859, "box": [[1096, 1542], [1263, 1542], [1263, 1572], [1096, 1572]]}, {"text": "Greater integer =?", "conf": 0.908, "box": [[179, 1603], [451, 1599], [451, 1636], [180, 1639]]}, {"text": "(-75) + _ = 45", "conf": 0.761, "box": [[175, 1669], [467, 1663], [468, 1710], [176, 1715]]}, {"text": "Forfinding themissing integerwesubtract-75from-45.", "conf": 0.936, "box": [[180, 1738], [1030, 1734], [1030, 1770], [181, 1774]]}, {"text": "45-(-75) =-45+75=30", "conf": 0.843, "box": [[182, 1807], [591, 1802], [592, 1838], [183, 1843]]}, {"text": "So, the greater integer is +30.", "conf": 0.882, "box": [[180, 1874], [614, 1871], [615, 1909], [181, 1913]]}, {"text": "46", "conf": 0.666, "box": [[820, 2029], [867, 2029], [867, 2064], [820, 2064]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.862, "box": [[1164, 2033], [1453, 2038], [1452, 2074], [1164, 2069]]}]}